  "limitations": [
    "Physical mouse/keyboard widget interaction remains unqualified: the automated Windows desktop did not grant foreground focus. Semantic scripted actions passed; lifecycle passed separately.",
    "Synchronous imports/transactions and serialized GPU waits; no representative project responsiveness, frame pacing or shipped-game performance qualification.",
    "Initial fixed panel layout, approximate bounds picking and limited typed inspectors. No gizmos, docking, multiselection, prefab editor, general component UI, game UI, package manager or accessibility bridge.",
    "History is session-local; serialized byte limit does not bound total heap usage. GPU cache counts exclude font atlas/driver memory.",
    "Play is an isolated inspection simulation; this GUI does not yet attach C# modules, route first-person controls or expose player audio output.",
    "GPU failure requires viewport recreation. Final capture can fail when minimized/unavailable; exclusive output writes can leave their own partial file after disk failure.",
    "Only this laptop NVIDIA/AMD Windows path is GPU-tested. Native Linux GUI and consoles are unqualified."
  ],
